# The Dockerfile needs backend/ and frontend/ only. An allow-list, so nothing local (an .env file,
# IDE config, credentials) reaches the build context unless it is listed here.
*
!backend/
!frontend/

# Build output and caches, rebuilt inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.gradle
**/.angular
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/.idea
**/.vscode
